 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">·         <b>Professional Experience:</b> 8-12+ years in database administration or engineering, with at least 4+ years in a Senior Engineering role focusing on cloud environments.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 51pt; line-height: 18pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">·         <b>AWS Database Mastery:</b> Expert-level knowledge of the AWS database ecosystem (Aurora, RDS, DynamoDB, Redshift).</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 51pt; line-height: 18pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: black;\">·         <b>Coding &amp; Scripting:</b> Proven mastery of Python and Advanced SQL for automation and sophisticated data manipulation.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 51pt; line-height: 18pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; f